#. Translators: Flare name in metainfo.
#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:50
#: data/de.schmidhuberj.Flare.desktop.in.in:4
#: data/de.schmidhuberj.Flare.metainfo.xml.in.in:8
msgid "Flare"
msgstr "Flare"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:53
msgid ""
"Flare is an unofficial Signal client. Note that Flare is not stable and "
"there are bugs to be expected. If you are experiencing any bugs, consult the "
"<a href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-mobile/flare/-/issues\">issue "
"tracker</a> and open issues if you are experiencing a new issue. Also note "
"that due to being a third-party application, Flare cannot guarantee the same "
"level of security and privacy as official Signal applications do. If you or "
"someone you need to contact requires a strong level of security, do not use "
"Flare. Consult the <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-mobile/flare/-/"
"blob/master/README.md#security\">README</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Flare on epävirallinen Signal-asiakas. Huomaa, että Flare ei ole vakaa ja "
"että vikoja on odotettavissa. Jos havaitset virheitä, tutustu <a "
"href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-mobile/flare/-/issues\">ongelmien "
"seurantaan</a> ja avaa ongelmat, jos kohtaat uuden antaa. Huomaa myös, että "
"koska Flare on kolmannen osapuolen sovellus, se ei voi taata samaa "
"suojaustasoa ja yksityisyyttä kuin viralliset signaalisovellukset. Jos sinä "
"tai joku, johon sinun on otettava yhteyttä, vaatii vahvaa suojaustasoa, älä "
"käytä Flarea. Katso <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-mobile/flare/-/"
"blob/master/README.md#security\">README</a> saadaksesi lisätietoja."

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:63 data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:70
msgid "Setup Primary Device or Link Device?"
msgstr "Aseta ensisijaiseksi laitteeksi vai linkitetyksi laitteeksi?"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:85 data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:316
#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:323
msgid "Primary Device"
msgstr "Ensisijainen laite"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:96 data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:150
#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:157
#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:174
msgid "Link Device"
msgstr "Linkitä laite"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:111
msgid "You can use Flare either as a primary or secondary device."
msgstr "Voit käyttää Flarea joko ensisijaisena tai linkitettynä laitteena"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:121
msgid "Linked Device (Recommended)"
msgstr "Linkitetty laite (suositellaan)"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:126
msgid ""
"Flare can be an application linked to your primary device, similar to the "
"official Signal Desktop. This mode has been more extensively tested and "
"mostly works."
msgstr ""
"Flare voi olla linkitettynä ensisijaiseen laitteeseesi, kuten Signal "
"Desktop. Tämä tila on paremmin testattu ja pääosin toimii."

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:136
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Primary Device (Disabled)"
msgid "Primary Device (Experimental)"
msgstr "Ensisijainen laite (pois käytöstä)"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:141
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Flare can act as a primary device, similar to the official Signal "
#| "applications on Android or IOS. This mode is currently not supported by "
#| "Flare, even though initial tests seem to indicate that it works. If you "
#| "are willing to test it, you may enable the button below (and if you don't "
#| "know how to do that, you should not think about testing primary-device "
#| "support)."
msgid ""
"Flare can act as a primary device, similar to the official Signal "
"applications on Android or IOS. This mode is currently experimental in "
"Flare. It is strongly recommended to link the official Signal Desktop "
"application after setting up Flare as a primary device to set up your "
"profile name and avatar, and to initialize chats with other people (both of "
"which cannot yet be done in Flare)."
msgstr ""
"Flare voi toimia ensisijaisena laitteena, kuten virallinen Signal sovellus "
"androidilla tai IOS:lla. Flare ei tällä hetkellä tue tätä tilaa, vaikka "
"alustavat kokeilut viittaavat siihen, että se toimii. Jos olet valmiina "
"kokeilemaan sitä, voit ottaa alla olevan napin käyttöön (jos et tiedä miten "
"se tehdään, sinun ei pitäisi harkita ensisijaisen laitteen tuen testaamista)."

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:191
msgid ""
"For linking as a secondary device, Flare will need a device name that will "
"be shown in the official application."
msgstr ""
"Toissijaisen laitteen linkittämiseen Flare tarvitsee laitteelle nimen, joka "
"näkyy virallisessa sovelluksessa."

